rooms_desc ({"This is a very friendly, warm, and cozy room. There are hard wood floors,with area rugs under the coach and the dinning room area (with four wooden chairs, a china cabinet with antiques, and old wooden table that has an antique Russian cut glass Vase with freshly cut seasonal flowers.) You noticethe main attraction a fire place with a nicely burning fire, that seems bothrelaxing and soothing.  Nearby there is a rocker that has a blacket on it, andbig fluffy pillows on the floor, along with a blanket or two...so if you wito curl up and fall asleep. You also notice in the distance the sounds of theocean pounding against the rugged coastline. You also see the moon dancing across the ocean through both the bay window that is open just enough for a nicenight breeze as the curtains dance along. There is a screen sun porch witha hammock. There are many smells that tickle your nose: night, salt, the sweetness of flowers, and something with apple and cinnamon baking inthe oven...perhaps an apple pie??? You are able to hear many sounds as well: the buring of crackling wood in the fire place, the bouys, theswirling of wind, and the simmering of the teakettle on the stovetop.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
